sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: To find medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a medial rectangle.
----
proof:

Set out the rational straight lines {A}, {B}, and {C} commensurable in square only. Take a mean proportional {D} between {A} and {B}. Let it be contrived that {B} is to {C} as {D} is to {E}. [!just VI.13; VI.12]

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="360" height="130" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.28 diagram" src="propX28.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
