    // beside A and E beside B. D is the mean proportional between A and B
    // (D2), and E the fourth proportional with B : C = D : E (E2). No
    // rectangles or squares are drawn in Joyce's figure, so "the rectangle
    // A by C" and "the square on D" light the lines themselves. Nothing is
    // added.
    //
    // Draggables (checked against the bundle): the lineSlider ends A1, A2,
