              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["B","C","D","E"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "B : D = C : E", ref: "V.16" }] },
            { text: "But {B} is to {D} as {D} is to {A}, therefore {D} is to {A} as {C} is to {E}.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["B","D","A","C","E"] },
            { text: "Therefore the rectangle {A} by {C} equals the rectangle {D} by {E}.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","C","D","E"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "rectangle A by C = rectangle D by E", ref: "VI.16" }] },
            { text: "But the rectangle {A} by {C} is medial, therefore the rectangle {D} by {E} is also medial.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","C","D","E"],
